          "id": "ha_s1",
          "order": 1,
          "text": {
            "en": "Call 112 now. Do not wait to see if the pain passes.",
            "hi": "अभी 112 पर कॉल करें। दर्द अपने आप जाने का इंतज़ार न करें।",
            "hinglish": "",
            "mr": ""
          },
          "source": {
            "doc": "G1",
            "page": 358,
            "quote_checked": false
          },
          "also_in": [],
          "agreement": "unchecked",
          "evidence": "unchecked",
          "next": "ha_s2",
          "verified": false,
          "verify_note": "VERIFY"
        },
        {
          "id": "ha_s2",
          "order": 2,
          "text": {
            "en": "Help them sit in the position they find most comfortable, and keep them still and calm.",
            "hi": "उन्हें उस स्थिति में बैठने में मदद करें जिसमें उन्हें सबसे ज़्यादा आराम लगे, और उन्हें स्थिर और शांत रखें।",
            "hinglish": "",
            "mr": ""
          },
          "source": {
            "doc": "G1",
            "page": 358,
            "quote_checked": false
          },
          "also_in": [],
